# Home Dashboard (Locked)

The `/experience` home tab is **approved and locked**. Do not modify unless the operator **explicitly requests a home-dashboard change in the active prompt** and **reconfirms** after you list every file you plan to touch.

## Protected surfaces

| Area | Role |
|------|------|
| `app/experience/page.tsx` | Route entry |
| `components/experience/dashboard/*` | Mobile dashboard shell, hero, cards, chrome |
| `lib/experience/awakening-dashboard-assets.ts` | Dashboard PNG paths |
| `lib/experience/dashboard-layout-spec.ts` | Card/slot layout tokens |

## Required before any edit

1. Operator named home/dashboard in the prompt — not inferred from adjacent work.
2. Agent lists all files to change and waits for explicit reconfirmation.
3. No unsolicited refactors, cleanup, or “while I’m here” edits.

## Forbidden without approval

- Layout, card positions, hero chrome, or dashboard PNG swaps
- Adding desktop variants or phone-frame clamps (`max-w-md`, etc.)
- Touching bottom nav PNG or hotspot config from dashboard work
